actions, [BUG: unable to handle kernel paging request at
ffffa136c7fe0000] occurs.

How to reproduce:
1. Compile the v4.17-rc7 kernel with the attached config
2. Unpack and mount attached FS as udf (supposing, mount point in /mnt)
